WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,420
A dozen people catch a rabbit

2
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:08,580
Almost exhausted

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:11,220
so big

4
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,220
less proud

5
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,260
Such a big sheep

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:14,980
Who knows if he was injured in the first place?

7
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,220
I'm lucky to be inspected by you

8
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,260
You are also lucky

9
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,820
A dozen people are one rabbit

10
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:22,340
There are stones and sticks, and some people have sprained their feet.

11
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,540
Someone got a piece of shit on their hands

12
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,660
Actually won in the end

13
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,660
worth celebrating

14
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:26,820
Stop talking

15
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,060
I suddenly felt that this rabbit

16
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,460
It's a bit embarrassing to eat

17
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:32,290
Leave some for me tonight

18
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:34,050
Let's finish today's work first

19
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,900
When did you two become so familiar?

20
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,140
Who should I talk to?

21
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,420
I have to give you a report first

22
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,820
When did you become the owner of the island?
